{"unit_id":"henryxiao709__dsh-pdf#card-zh","repo":"henryxiao709/dsh-pdf","commit":"d2c0dffecbcc139e9a6f594d7790ac9e5fa1f3d2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pdf 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的 PDF 阅读插件，通过 read_pdf 工具读取 PDF 页面文本，并在扫描或文本稀少的页面执行 OCR。它支持按页码或范围选择页面，提供自动、仅文本和强制 OCR 模式，可使用 Windows OCR 或 tesseract.js。结果逐页返回文本、来源和页码，并可限制文件大小、处理页数和每页字符数。用户可在 DSH 设置界面调整 OCR 引擎、阈值、缓存和临时目录，适合需要让 DSH 阅读 PDF、扫描文档或中文资料的场景。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:92-115","lib/tool.js:70-130"]}
{"unit_id":"henryxiao709__dsh-pdf#card-en","repo":"henryxiao709/dsh-pdf","commit":"d2c0dffecbcc139e9a6f594d7790ac9e5fa1f3d2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-pdf lets DSH read PDF pages with read_pdf. It extracts text, selects pages or ranges, and can OCR scanned pages using Windows OCR or tesseract.js. Results include page numbers, text, and source. Settings control OCR options, reading limits, caching, and temporary files.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:92-115","lib/tool.js:70-130"]}
