{"unit_id":"henryxiao709__dsh-pdf#feature-1","repo":"henryxiao709/dsh-pdf","commit":"d2c0dffecbcc139e9a6f594d7790ac9e5fa1f3d2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pdf 的功能「按页读取 PDF」：read_pdf 读取指定 PDF 并逐页返回文本。可传入单页、页码范围或多个页段，也可省略页码读取全部页面；结果包含页码、文本和来源。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tool.js:11-29","lib/tool.js:70-130"]}
{"unit_id":"henryxiao709__dsh-pdf#feature-2","repo":"henryxiao709/dsh-pdf","commit":"d2c0dffecbcc139e9a6f594d7790ac9e5fa1f3d2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pdf 的功能「扫描页 OCR」：read_pdf 可在自动模式下识别文本层较少的页面，也可强制对每页执行 OCR。它支持 Windows OCR 和 tesseract.js，并在页面结果中标出文本来自 OCR、文本层或两者混合。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tool.js:130-200","lib/ocr.js:140-200"]}
{"unit_id":"henryxiao709__dsh-pdf#feature-3","repo":"henryxiao709/dsh-pdf","commit":"d2c0dffecbcc139e9a6f594d7790ac9e5fa1f3d2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pdf 的功能「调整 PDF 读取设置」：DSH 设置界面提供 OCR 引擎、触发阈值、渲染比例、超时、文件和页数限制、每页字符数及缓存目录等选项；保存后配置立即生效并清除结果缓存。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:25-44","lib/index.js:106-115","src/client.jsx:1-90"]}
